    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35039" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĕrīclĭtābundus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		periclitor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>trying</i>, <i>testing</i>, <i>making a trial</i> or <i>essay</i>
			(post-class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With
				<i>acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puncto pollicis extremam aciem (sagittae)
					periclitabunda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 5, p. 168, 34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">voluntatem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Mag. p. 308, 18</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			With <i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 3, p. 138, 33</span></i>
			.</div>
